  },
  {
    question: 'Does it replace parenting or classroom support?',
    answer: 'No. It is a storybook, not a therapeutic program. It can support warm conversations about confidence and self-trust with a caring grown-up.',
  },
  {
    question: 'Why make a confidence book personalized?',
    answer: 'Personalization can help the child connect with the message because the hero can reflect their look, name, hometown, pronouns, and companion choice.',
